	)
	(text "AVDD supplies 3.3 V for internal analog circuitry from VM when not sleeping\nDVDD supplies 1.5 V for internal digital logic from FB_BK when not sleeping\nFB_BK is externally powered with 3.3 V and the buck converter is disabled to reduce the BOM per application note SLLA643\n\nNFAULT is open-drain, has an internal pull-up to AVDD that can be disabled via I2C, SLLA643 says never use external and internal pull-up together\nSPEED/WAKE has an internal 1 Mohm pull-down for noise immunity and is configured via I2C to wake the device from sleep when high\nI2C controls all device functions except wake-up and watchdog"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 71.12 140.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "df8091d3-abb0-407e-8f7a-add3735b572a")
	)
